<title>USA: Box Energy names operating chief.</title>
<headline>Box Energy names operating chief.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Box Energy Corp said Friday James A. Watt will join the company as president and chief operating officer, succeeding Don D. Box, who continues as chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Watt, 47, was previously exploration vice president at Seagull Energy Corp.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
